  <name>ServerBox</name>
  <summary>Monitor and manage servers over SSH or Monitor</summary>
  <developer id="tech.lolli">
    <name>lollipopkit</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>ServerBox is a cross-platform server status monitor and administration toolbox built with Flutter and Rust. Connect directly over SSH, through jump hosts, or over HTTP via ServerBox Monitor.</p>
    <p>Key capabilities include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Real-time and historical metrics for CPU, memory, swap, disks, disk I/O, network, sensors, GPUs, batteries, and disk S.M.A.R.T.</li>
      <li>Full terminal emulator with tmux support, split-pane workspaces, and synced input across multiple sessions</li>
      <li>File browser and editor over SFTP, SCP, or the Monitor API, plus RDP and VNC remote desktop</li>
      <li>Management for Docker and Podman containers, processes, systemd services, users, firewalls, storage, scheduled tasks, and port forwards</li>
      <li>Virtualization management for libvirt and Proxmox VE, and hardware control over Redfish BMC</li>
      <li>Built-in AI Agent and App MCP server for server automation, encrypted backup and sync, and custom themes</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
